  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "At Porter Family Dentistry, we take every step possible to ensure you have the most comfortable visit possible, and that goes beyond our pain-free dentistry. We are backed by 35 years of service and our staff has a combined experience of 177 years, specializing in empathy and compassionate service."
